jobs.description:
We are looking for experienced Senior Java Developers, who would like to work at the European Commission in Brussels. EU candidates need to be fluent in English and willing to work in Brussels. 



Tasks and responsibilities: 




• Test driven Java development and maintenance of web-based applications; 

• Development and integration of technological components 

• Implementation of user requirements; 

• Prototyping; 

• Elaboration of test programs; 

• Integration with other applications; 


• Bachelor or Master degree or comparable through experience; 

• +5 / +10 / +15 years of Java experience; 

• Good level of English;
